{"title":"Emergent Ventures winners 48th cohort","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/927826793/0/marginalrevolution~Emergent-Ventures-winners-th-cohort.html","date":1763273224000,"content":"<p>Minh Nguyen, Dallas, 16, to address problems of space debris.</p>\r\n<p>Serena Chen and Valerie Wu, Taipei and Los Angeles, better blood transportation.</p>\r\n<p>Griffin Li, Boston, 19, general career support, issues in market pricing on apps.</p>\r\n<p>Jamie Croucher, London, for a new scientific society, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://ilikethefuture.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Society for Technological Advancement</a>.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.linkedin.com/in/srianumakonda/\" target=\"_blank\">Sri Anumakonda</a>, Carnegie Mellon, robotic hands.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.benjames.io/\" target=\"_blank\">Ben James</a>, London, lowering the price of electricity.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://profiles.stanford.edu/lucio-aurelio-moreira-de-menezes\" target=\"_blank\">Lucio Aurelio Moreira Menezes</a>, Fortaleza and Stanford, computational biology.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~lgilbert.co/\" target=\"_blank\">Lauren Gilbert</a>, London, a progress-oriented magazine for the developing world?</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.linkedin.com/posts/annika-baberwal-77062a288_neuroengineering-spinalcordinjury-hydrogels-activity-7358166532935368705-axiW/\" target=\"_blank\">Annika Baberwal</a>, Dubai, 8<sup>th</sup> grade, helping race cars run faster.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.linkedin.com/in/bernardo-melotti-a1b643263/\" target=\"_blank\">Bernardo Melotti</a>, Bologna/Stanford,  equipment to speed biological advances.</p>\r\n<p>Elyas Sepahi, London, mathematics and machine learning.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.linkedin.com/in/harishvin-sasikumar/?originalSubdomain=ca\" target=\"_blank\">Harishvin Sashikumar</a>, Vancouver, 17, brain interfaces.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/emergent-ventures-winners-48th-cohort.html\">Emergent Ventures winners 48th cohort</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/927826793/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/927826793/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/927826793/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/927826793/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/927826793/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/927826793/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/emergent-ventures-winners-48th-cohort.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/emergent-ventures-winners-48th-cohort.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/mar